Commercial use is prohibited under this license, including internal business use; paid consulting or client work; sale, rental, or paid distribution; use in commercial products; providing paid hosted services, APIs, or software-as-a-service; and research, development, training, or evaluation intended for commercial application. This restriction applies equally to the software, modified versions, and works based on it, regardless of whether the software itself is sold or provided without charge.

An organization's charitable, educational, research, governmental, or nonprofit status does not create an exception for commercial use. Noncommercial study, teaching, research, and personal projects remain permitted only when they satisfy the definition above. Any commercial use requires a separate written license from the relevant rights holder; this license grants no commercial permission.

